---
const {id}=Astro.props,codex=id==='codex-usage',command=codex?'/status':'/usage';
const rows=codex?[['Session','5 hours','The session deadline shown in the reading','Codex CLI or the Codex tab'],['Weekly','7 days','The weekly deadline shown in the reading','Codex CLI or the Codex tab']]:[['Session','5 hours','The end of the current session window','Claude Code /usage or the Claude Code tab'],['Weekly','7 days','The weekly reset shown by Claude','Claude Code /usage or the Claude Code tab'],['Model-specific weekly','7 days, when reported','The reset on that model’s own row','Claude Code /usage, if the plan lists it']];
---
<section class="guide-tool block" id="quick-answer"><h2>Quick answer</h2><p>{codex?'Codex reports session and weekly windows with separate reset times.':'Claude Code reports session and weekly windows separately, with model-specific rows when available.'}</p><table class="quick-table"><caption class="sr-only">Plan windows and reset times</caption><thead><tr>{['Window','Length','What resets it','Where to see it'].map(l=><th scope="col">{l}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(row=><tr>{row.map((cell,i)=>i===0?<th scope="row">{cell}</th>:<td data-label={['','Length','What resets it','Where to see it'][i]}>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></section>
<section class="guide-tool block" id="commands"><h2>Commands</h2><p>Enter <code>{command}</code> inside an active {codex?'Codex CLI':'Claude Code'} session to see the account readout.</p><div class="command-surface"><span>{codex?'Codex CLI':'Claude Code'}</span><pre><code>{command}</code></pre></div><a href={codex?'https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli/slash-commands/':'https://code.claude.com/docs/en/interactive-mode'}>{codex?'Codex CLI slash commands':'Claude Code interactive commands'}</a></section>
